# A release checklist that names exactly what the suite reads

## The documentation matches what the build produces

Nothing decides this yet, and what is missing is a decision rather than a check.
The issue is #62.

The pages read against the tree on every run rather than trusted are
`docs/alpha.md` and `docs/beta.md`.

This is the neighbour that has to stay accepted. A reader that refused every
backticked word would satisfy each refusal beside it and say nothing about the
real page.
